<li><b>The PDF manual, designed.</b> Set in Inter (light body text, bundled with the book), a cover with the Autonomy strip above the title, chapter openers with a large numeral, section numbers hanging in the margin, figure captions, and an Autonomy header and footer on every page.</li>
<li>Help &#8250; Asobi Manual: <b>Open PDF Manual</b> &#8212; it opens in Preview; save from there if you want a copy.</li>
</ul>
